            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Realised profit per session.\n\n- **Gross P&L** — profit from price movement alone.\n- **Net P&L** — gross minus all charges.\n\nThe gap between the two bars is the cost of trading."
    },
